# SoundPlant demo: synthwave, 108 BPM, F# minor. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# A neon night drive in F# minor, 112 bars. A toy-keys arp opens alone and bookends the song. The verse is F#m D A E,
# the pre climbs Bm7 C#m7 Dmaj7 E under a rising line, the chorus (D E C#m F#m) is a rising-arpeggio lead over a rolling
# octave bass with a gated-reverb snare and a choir that answers on beat 4. The half-time bridge floats over an F# pedal,
# a D#7 leans into the last chorus, and the conductor lifts it two semitones to G# minor.
# T1 kit  T2 knit round sub (arp player: rolling octaves)  T3 knit ribbon strings  T4 knit soft lead (the hook)
# T5 rayon toy keys (arp player: the motif)  T6 knit dusty pad (drone on locks)  T7 rayon glass bell  T8 voile ooh choir
# Song: intro 8, verse 8, pre 4, chorus 8, drive 8, verse 2 8, pre 4, chorus 8, bridge 8, build 8, last chorus 16 (+2),
# drive 8, coda 16.
bpm 108
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 6
knob 9 e3 1

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the kit: a big kick, a gated-reverb snare with a clap on top, tight hats, toms for the fills
knob 1 d1.k1 66
knob 1 d1.k2 58
knob 1 d1.k3 84
knob 1 d1.k4 60
knob 1 d1.volume 94
knob 1 d2.k1 60
knob 1 d2.k2 44
knob 1 d2.k3 96
knob 1 d2.k4 100
knob 1 d2.volume 92
knob 1 d2.send2 112
knob 1 d5.k4 44
knob 1 d5.volume 68
knob 1 d5.send2 72
knob 1 d3.volume 44
knob 1 d4.volume 38
knob 1 d4.send2 30
knob 1 d6.volume 66
knob 1 d6.send2 78
knob 1 d7.volume 64
knob 1 d7.send2 78
knob 1 level 94
# T2 a knit round sub through the arp player: eighth pulses, rolling octaves in the choruses
preset 2 round_sub knit
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain 2
knob 2 cut 64
knob 2 res 16
knob 2 player arp
knob 2 p1 1/8
knob 2 p2 up
knob 2 p3 1
knob 2 ap1 medium
knob 2 level 94
# T3 a knit ribbon: the string-machine chords
preset 3 ribbon knit
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain 2
knob 3 level 70
knob 3 pan 72
knob 3 send1 12
knob 3 send2 36
# T4 a knit soft lead: the voice of the song, in the echo and the hall
preset 4 soft_lead knit
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 brain 2
knob 4 level 90
knob 4 pan 56
knob 4 send1 42
knob 4 send2 38
# T5 rayon toy keys through the arp player: sixteenth arpeggios up the chord, wide
preset 5 toy_keys rayon
param 5 oct 2
knob 5 brain 2
knob 5 player arp
knob 5 p1 1/16
knob 5 p2 up
knob 5 p3 1
knob 5 ap1 short
knob 5 ap4 wide
knob 5 level 68
knob 5 pan 34
knob 5 send1 44
knob 5 send2 30
# T6 a knit dusty pad: a drone that breathes on filter locks, pumped by the kit
preset 6 dusty_pad knit
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain 2
knob 6 ltype pump
knob 6 lspeed track_1
knob 6 lamt 34
knob 6 level 58
knob 6 pan 68
knob 6 send2 48
# T7 rayon glass bell: glints and risers in the echo and the hall
preset 7 glass_bell rayon
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 brain 2
knob 7 level 62
knob 7 pan 96
knob 7 send1 52
knob 7 send2 56
# T8 voile ooh choir: the sidechain-style pulse in the verses, the answer to the lead in the choruses
preset 8 ooh_choir voile
param 8 oct 2
knob 8 brain 2
knob 8 ltype pump
knob 8 lspeed track_1
knob 8 lamt 40
knob 8 level 72
knob 8 pan 40
knob 8 send1 22
knob 8 send2 52
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo, FX II a hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 108
knob 11 e3 50
knob 11 e4 48
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 66
knob 12 e3 54
mst lo 60
mst hi 56
mst comp 46
mst pump 22
mst pumpby kick
mst release 70
mst level 104

