# ---- scenes and the song: the mask is T1..T8, COND, THROW; x = muted
# intro A: the toy-keys motif alone on bar 1, then the drone, the bell
scenedef 1 1 1 1 1 1 8 1 1 1 1
scenemute 1 xxxx...x..
# intro B: the kit builds a bar at a time, the bass and the choir pulse come in
scenedef 2 1 1 1 1 1 2 2 1 1 1
scenemute 2 ..xx......
# verse A: F#m D A E, the groove, the arp, the pulse
scenedef 3 2 1 1 1 1 2 2 1 1 1
scenemute 3 ..xx..x...
# verse B: the strings and the chimes join
scenedef 4 2 1 1 1 1 2 2 1 1 4
scenemute 4 ...x......
# pre: Bm7 C#m7 Dmaj7 E, the bass climbs, the lead rises, the filter opens, the kit builds
scenedef 5 3 2 2 1 3 3 3 2 1 2
scenemute 5 ..........
# chorus A: D E C#m F#m, the cell over the rolling octaves, the gated snare
scenedef 6 4 3 3 2 4 4 4 3 1 1
scenemute 6 ......x...
# chorus B: the answer falls home, the toms, the echo
scenedef 7 5 4 3 2 4 4 4 3 1 3
scenemute 7 ..........
# drive A: four on the floor, the cell over the verse chords, the choir answers
scenedef 8 6 1 1 4 1 2 2 5 1 1
scenemute 8 ..x...x...
# drive B: the strings and the chimes, the cell opens up
scenedef 9 6 1 1 4 1 2 2 5 1 1
scenemute 9 ..........
# verse 2 A: F#m7 Dmaj7 A/C# E, the bass walks down, sighs from the lead
scenedef 10 2 7 7 5 2 2 2 1 1 1
scenemute 10 ......x...
# verse 2 B: the chimes join
scenedef 11 2 7 7 5 2 2 2 1 1 4
scenemute 11 ..........
# pre 2: the climb again
scenedef 12 3 2 2 1 3 3 3 2 1 2
scenemute 12 ..........
# chorus 2 A: the hook with the bells
scenedef 13 4 3 3 2 4 4 4 3 1 1
scenemute 13 ..........
# chorus 2 B: the answer falls home, the toms, then the bridge opens
scenedef 14 5 4 3 2 4 4 4 3 1 1
scenemute 14 ..........
# bridge A: half time over an F# pedal, Dmaj7/F# C#m7/F#, a long tune
scenedef 15 7 5 5 6 5 5 5 6 1 1
scenemute 15 ..........
# bridge B: Bm9 Dmaj7 C#m7 C#7sus4, the tune climbs, the choir steps down
scenedef 16 7 6 6 6 6 5 5 7 1 1
scenemute 16 ..........
# build A: the kick returns, the climb under a snare that speeds up
scenedef 17 1 2 2 1 3 3 6 2 1 1
scenemute 17 ..........
# build B: the bass rolls octaves up to D#7, the kit builds, then one beat of silence
scenedef 18 3 8 8 8 7 6 6 2 1 5
scenemute 18 ..........
# drive out A: home again in F# minor, the cell
scenedef 23 6 1 1 4 1 2 2 5 1 1
scenemute 23 ..........
# drive out B: the lead drops out, the echo
scenedef 24 6 1 1 4 1 2 2 5 1 3
scenemute 24 ..xx...x..
# coda A: the groove thins, the hook's last phrase, the bell sings the motif
scenedef 25 2 1 1 7 1 7 8 8 1 1
scenemute 25 ..x.......
# coda B: no drums, no bass, the motif and the drone
scenedef 26 2 1 1 7 1 7 8 8 1 1
scenemute 26 xxx.......
# coda C: the toy keys, the bell and the choir
scenedef 27 1 1 1 7 8 7 8 8 1 1
scenemute 27 xxxx......
# coda D: the toy keys over the drone, the choir and a last shimmer, then the chord rings out
scenedef 28 1 1 1 1 8 7 1 8 1 1
scenemute 28 xxxx......
knob 9 e3 9
# last chorus A, two semitones up: E F# D#m G#m, the D#7 resolves late
scenedef 19 8 3 3 2 4 4 7 3 2 1
scenemute 19 ..........
# last chorus B: the answer falls home in G# minor
scenedef 20 5 4 3 2 4 4 7 3 2 1
scenemute 20 ..........
# last chorus C: the lead reaches, the strings comp
scenedef 21 8 3 4 3 4 4 7 4 2 1
scenemute 21 ..........
# last chorus D: the tune lands home, the echo
scenedef 22 5 4 4 3 4 4 7 4 2 3
scenemute 22 ..........
knob 9 e3 1
song 1:4 2:4 3:4 4:4 5:4 6:4 7:4 8:4 9:4 10:4 11:4 12:4 13:4 14:4 15:4 16:4 17:4 18:4 19:4 20:4 21:4 22:4 23:4 24:4 25:4 26:4 27:4 28:4
songloop 0
expect lanes <65

# ---- play the song (HOME, SELECT to the Song page, PLAY)
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
stats reset
wav soundplant_demo_synthwave.wav
tap PLAY
bars 112
wait 3000
wavstop
stats
